Hi Avery,

Here's what's new in Vanta this month.

Renewal readiness
If your SOC 2 Type II observation window ends in the next 90 days, your dashboard now shows a readiness score, the tests that need attention, and a suggested audit date. Auditor scheduling is built in.

Vanta AI agent
Ask "which employees haven't completed security training?" or "show me every failing test for AWS" and get an answer with links, not a report to dig through.

New integrations
Linear, Ramp, Rippling, and Snowflake added this month, bringing the total to 375.

Access reviews
Quarterly access reviews can now be assigned to system owners, with reminders and an audit-ready export.

